TICKET-106: Daily verse service

Priority: P1 · Estimate: 3 pts · Depends on: 101
`GET /v1/verse/today` returns a verse in English + Amharic.

Tasks

- Source Amharic scripture from a public-domain Amharic Bible dataset (e.g., the 1962 Haile Selassie Version if licensing permits — verify licensing first) loaded into Firestore
- Curated verse rotation list (365 entries) checked into repo as data, reviewed by you
- Response cached at the edge (Cache-Control: 24h) — this endpoint should basically never cost anything
- Fallback verse if lookup fails (never show an empty card)

Acceptance criteria

- Verse text verified against source for at least 10 spot-checked entries
- Endpoint serves from cache after first daily hit
- Licensing note documented in `docs/`
